{
 "about": [
  "Committed, checkable map from Calibrator declarations to the gnomon code they",
  "claim to describe. Anchored to declaration NAMES plus content hashes, never to",
  "line numbers: a line-pinned table is stale the moment anybody adds an import,",
  "and extract/test_parser.py is currently failing for exactly that reason.",
  "",
  "correspondence classes:",
  "  exact       the Lean body and the code compute the same function, and the",
  "              numeric differential in correctability_calculator/tests/ runs",
  "              them against each other on the committed fixture grid",
  "  approximate the two are deliberately different, and the difference is stated",
  "              here and proved in the corpus",
  "  absent      shipped behaviour with NO invariant in the corpus. These are the",
  "              findings, kept in the table so that they are enumerable rather",
  "              than invisible. Adding an entry here is not absolution; it is a",
  "              debt the corpus can count.",
  "",
  "Re-record the hashes with `python3 map_check.py --bless`, which is the",
  "deliberate act of saying both sides were re-read and still correspond."
 ],
